# vhs docs/demo.tape → docs/sitrep.gif   (needs vhs, ttyd, ffmpeg)
Output docs/sitrep.gif
Set Shell bash
Set FontSize 14
Set Width 1200
Set Height 640
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 40ms

Type "sitrep --demo"
Enter
Sleep 2s
Type "2"
Sleep 2s
Type "j"
Sleep 300ms
Type "j"
Sleep 300ms
Enter
Sleep 2s
Escape
Sleep 500ms
Type " "
Sleep 1500ms
Type "l"
Sleep 2s
Type "1"
Sleep 2s
Type "q"
